// title: Top 100 users that have the most interactive sign ins · Defender XDR
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender for Identity
// tables: IdentityLogonEvents
// purpose: Visualize the top 100 users that have performed the most interactive sign ins.
// source: https://github.com/Bert-JanP/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/65d11700e1cb878403d87312acdd6b9a8dd622c1/Defender%20For%20Identity/Visualization%20-%20MostInteractiveSignInsByUser.md
// kind: repo
// author: Bert-Jan Pals
// license: BSD-3-Clause (as stated by the repository)
// archived by tools/kql_archive.py (CLAUDE.md 5l, 5eu)
IdentityLogonEvents
| where LogonType == 'Interactive'
| where isempty(FailureReason)
| distinct AccountUpn, DeviceName
| summarize TotalUniqueInteractiveSignIns = count() by AccountUpn
| top 100 by TotalUniqueInteractiveSignIns
| render columnchart with (title="Top 100 users that have the most interactive sign ins")
